# Figures 60-64 (Section 7): CassWithExitPupil.in: at the detector (element 6, the focal field -- the 3.2 figures
# were made there) AMP then PHASE (one page each), REAL (real and imaginary pages), IMGMODE CONV + WIRE on INT 6;
# at the exit pupil (element 5) CONTOUR on OPD 5, COLUMN (the center column) on
# OPD 5.  Pages: 0 amp, 1 phase, 2-3 real, 4 wire, 5 contour, 6 column (+ a repeat).  fig_engine_60 = [0 | 1], 61 = [2 | 3], 62 = 4, 63 = 5, 64 = 6.
